stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PLANNING
  PLANNING --> WAITING_FOR_HUMAN: Validated recommendation
  PLANNING --> NO_MATCH: No eligible candidate
  PLANNING --> FAILED: Model or validation error
  WAITING_FOR_HUMAN --> APPROVED: Human approves
  WAITING_FOR_HUMAN --> REJECTED: Human rejects
  WAITING_FOR_HUMAN --> EXPIRED: Quote expires
  APPROVED --> EXPIRED: Expires before execution
  APPROVED --> VERIFYING: Idempotent execution
  VERIFYING --> COMPLETED: Receipt matches
  VERIFYING --> VERIFICATION_FAILED: Receipt mismatch
  VERIFICATION_FAILED --> COMPLETED: Receipt verified on retry
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
